  "description": "The OXVA Xlim SQ Pro 2 is a compact, high-performance pod kit that builds on the Xlim series with a host of advanced features, including a full-colour HD touchscreen, intelligent puff tracking, and ultra-fast charging. With a 1600mAh battery and up to 30W of power, this device is built for reliable, all-day MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-lung) vaping. The SQ Pro 2’s standout feature is its 0.96” smart touchscreen, offering a responsive interface for navigating modes, adjusting wattage, and monitoring usage. You can choose between Smart Mode for automatic coil detection and Power Mode for manual control, while real-time puff tracking and a 30-day usage log offer helpful insights into your vaping habits. The screen also supports up to 64 customisation combinations and 12 language settings, allowing for a tailored user experience. The device recharges in just 45 minutes via USB-C (5V/2A) and is compatible with the full OXVA Xlim pod range, including Top-Fill (V3), V2, and Prefilled pods. Each kit includes two mesh-coil Top-Fill pods (0.6ohm and 0.8ohm) designed for excellent flavour and satisfying vapour using either nicotine salt or 50/50 freebase e-liquid . With adjustable airflow, draw or button activation, and a compact ergonomic ‘matchbox’ profile, the SQ Pro 2 combines everyday convenience with premium-level performance. Please note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the vape juice to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
